*Note.* $R$ = individual-level ICC (95% CI from 1,000 bootstraps) for pooled, morph-adjusted, and morph + round models. rTEM = within-individual SD/mean × 100; ICC(A,1) = single-measure absolute agreement; maximum bias = largest round-pair bias (% of mean); $p$ = Holm-adjusted across traits. Estimates used 48 individuals (142--144 observations; 47--48 complete triplets). No order drift was detected (minimum Benjamini--Hochberg-adjusted $p$: 0.524 signed, 0.867 absolute).
